  "resolution_criteria": "This question will resolve as the financial amount (in US Dollars) reported under \"Contributions and grants\" (Part 1, Section 8 - Revenue) in [the Form 990 tax filing](https://projects.propublica.org/nonprofits/organizations/822281466) for Wild Animal Initiative Inc. for the fiscal year ending December 2026.",
  "fine_print": "If Wild Animal Initiative ceases to exist or no Form 990 tax filing is made for the fiscal year ending December 2026, this question will be **annulled**.",
  "background": "[Wild Animal Initiative](https://www.wildanimalinitiative.org/) is a non-profit organization based in Minnesota. Its mission is to accelerate science that helps wild animals globally. It has three programs: producing original research, providing grants to scientists, and further supporting those scientists studying wild animal welfare.\n\n[Animal Charity Evaluators](https://animalcharityevaluators.org/charity-review/wild-animal-initiative/) (ACE) has recommended Wild Animal Initiative each year from 2021 to 2025.\n\nThe total amount of charitable contributions received by Wild Animal Initiative in recent years, according to tax filings, are below:\n\n| **Year** | **Contributions** (as Sources of Revenue) |   |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------------- | - |\n| 2018     | \\$85,838                                  |   |\n| 2019     | \\$717,018                                 |   |\n| 2020     | \\$605,880                                 |   |\n| 2021     | \\$5,085,952                               |   |\n| 2022     | \\$1,724,454                               |   |\n| 2023     | \\$6,817,971                               |   |\n| 2024     | \\$2,325,327                               |   |",
